## Lessons this project has paid for

<!-- One line per lesson, bolded name first; the history and worked example go in the
     matching section of docs/agents/lessons.md (.forge/lessons-template.md). -->

- **Concurrent sessions in one checkout**: give each agent session its own `git worktree`; a shared `HEAD` and index silently cross-contaminate.
- **Off-the-shelf first**: before hand-rolling more than about 20 lines of generic infrastructure, find the library.
- **Don't switch branches under a running test run**: no branch switch, stash or checkout in a worktree while a background test run is still executing there.
